# Incoming work staged for review. Untrusted by definition and deleted once a
# merge lands, so it stays out of history — only the README is tracked. Drop
# these two lines if you ever want a drop committed for reference.
/_incoming/*
!/_incoming/README.md

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.DS_Store
